{"unit_id":"LingyeSoul__dsh-rider#card-zh","repo":"LingyeSoul/dsh-rider","commit":"7aadebd56c41995ca828e0ec19262608ca9d1e53","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-rider 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的插件，提供免费网页搜索、图片理解、输入框图片捕获和文件暂存。它在 DSH 注册 duckduckgo_search 与 vision_understand 工具，通过独立设置页及输入框扩展连接搜索、视觉模型和会话工作区。搜索优先使用 DuckDuckGo，失败时回退 Bing；视觉工具可调用已配置的图片模型，将图片来源转换为文字描述；文件暂存会把会话附件清单随下一条消息交给 agent。适合需要联网检索、在文本模型会话中查看图片或把任意文件加入工作区的 DSH 用户。无需额外 API key；视觉理解需要配置可用的视觉模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:643-792","index.mjs:1033-1070","index.mjs:1272-1284","client/index.js:1815-1860"]}
{"unit_id":"LingyeSoul__dsh-rider#card-en","repo":"LingyeSoul/dsh-rider","commit":"7aadebd56c41995ca828e0ec19262608ca9d1e53","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-rider adds web search, image understanding, and file stashing to DSH Web. It registers search and vision tools plus composer controls. Search falls back from DuckDuckGo to Bing; vision uses a configured model, and stashed workspace files are passed to the agent. Search needs no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:643-792","index.mjs:1033-1070","index.mjs:1272-1284","client/index.js:1815-1860"]}
